design is subjective. there's just no way of&nbsp;
getting around that fact. and architecture in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:14.800
a lot of ways is the art of convincing people that&nbsp;
your design moves were the right moves. and one of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:20.320
the ways you can convince people is through case&nbsp;
studies. i think of case studies like a shield.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:26.560
if you present it correctly, it can be a very&nbsp;
powerful way for you to defend your design moves,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:32.080
especially if you're choosing a project that's&nbsp;
been successful before and it's been done by a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:39.840
