00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:46.720
from, and it can be a lot harder to poke holes&nbsp;
at something that's been proven to be successful&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:54.720
before. there is a lot of information out there on&nbsp;
how to do case studies but not so much on how to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:54.720 --> 00:01:00.560
present them. so if you're looking for information&nbsp;
