00:04:40.400 --> 00:04:46.960
so first simplify. so presenting a case study&nbsp;
is very different from doing a case study.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:46.960 --> 00:04:52.000
when you're doing a case study you might learn a&nbsp;
