like they take a massive sample and then&nbsp;
they make some assumptions based on that.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:56.160
and so we want to do the same thing. we&nbsp;
want to study a bunch of different buildings&nbsp;&nbsp;

